## 10. SPRINT 11 FEATURES (SOCIAL CORE)

### Pickup Games

**Purpose:** Find teammates for open play sessions

**Key Tables:**
- `pickup_games` — Session details (host, court, time, max_players, price_per_person)
- `pickup_game_participants` — Players joined (split_amount, payment_status)
- `pickup_game_messages` — Chat between participants

**API Endpoints:**
- `GET /api/pickup-games` — List open games
- `POST /api/pickup-games` — Create game (host)
- `POST /api/pickup-games/[id]/join` — Join game
- `POST /api/pickup-games/[id]/leave` — Leave game
- `GET /api/pickup-games/[id]/messages` — Get chat
- `POST /api/pickup-games/[id]/messages` — Send message

**Rules:**
- Host creates game + sets price_per_person
- Participants pay split_amount (auto-calculated)
- Chat is light (polling, not WebSocket yet)
- Game status: open → full → completed/cancelled

### Team Wallets

**Purpose:** Shared wallet for team bookings

**Key Tables:**
- `team_wallets` — Wallet details (owner, balance, members)
- `team_wallet_members` — Members with roles (owner, admin, member)
- `team_wallet_deposits` — Money in (from members)
- `team_wallet_transactions` — Money out (for bookings)

**API Endpoints:**
- `POST /api/team-wallets` — Create wallet
- `POST /api/team-wallets/[id]/deposits` — Deposit money
- `POST /api/team-wallets/[id]/booking` — Pay booking from wallet
- `GET /api/team-wallets/[id]/transactions` — Transaction history

**Rules:**
- Owner creates wallet + invites members
- Members deposit money (manual confirmation for now)
- Wallet pays bookings (deduct balance)
- Transaction log for audit

### Flash Deals

**Purpose:** Last-minute discounts for empty slots

**Key Table:** `flash_deals`

**API Endpoints:**
- `GET /api/flash-deals` — List active deals
- `POST /api/flash-deals/[id]/claim` — Claim deal

**Rules:**
- Owner creates deal for specific court + time
- Deal expires at scheduled time
- First customer to claim gets discount
- Prevent double-claim (unique